<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 25.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Nov 25.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Monday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali sends message to annual magistrate's congress held on Sunday in Tunis. President says independence of magistrates is the state's choice.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Tunisia celebrates on Monday the 13th century of the foundation of the Islamic Zitouna university in Tunis.</p>
